Users cannot be confirmed to receive incoming tokens from other evm chains.

Tranche tokens can be transferred through Axelar gateway but the gateway contract mints and burns tranche tokens without the help of [Axelar Interchain tokens](https://docs.axelar.dev/dev/send-tokens/interchain-tokens#new-interchain-tokens).
