# Vulnerability details

## Impact
Contract LiquidityPool.sol the method withdraw(uint256 assets, address receiver, address owner);
Upon reviewing the smart contract, the withdrawal function currently permits any address to request an asset withdrawal without verifying if the address holds any assets in the pool. This may potentially create a security vulnerability, enabling both malicious and inadvertent users to withdraw assets to which they have no entitlement.

## Proof of Concept
