# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The function does not include a `auth` modifier. Which means that anyone can call the execute proposal. This means that if there is a scheduleRely of a malicious address delayed admin did not perform due diligence. The malicious attacker can call the executeScheduleRely, and allow them to fully control all contracts as root contracts are ward of all contracts. This allows the attacker to remove all other wards and maintain full control of the protocol.

